Package: freedomnas-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, freedomnas-core, freedomnas-profiles, python3 (>= 3.7), dialog, gdisk, dosfstools, zfsutils-linux, debootstrap, dracut, efibootmgr, parted
Description: FreedomNAS ZFS-on-root installer
 Interactive TUI installer that provisions a FreedomNAS ZFS-on-root system:
  • Disk partitioning and ZFS pool/dataset creation
  • Base system installation via debootstrap
  • Boot chain setup — a dracut-built Unified Kernel Image (UKI), loaded
    directly via efibootmgr on UEFI or via Clover on legacy BIOS
  • User and package configuration
 .
 Depends on freedomnas-core for command execution (freedomnas.engine) and
 freedomnas-profiles for the OS command translation tables.
